# API Observability and Health

- Structured JSON logs: method, path, status, duration; **no** secrets/PII.
- Honor or generate `X-Request-Id` / correlation ID; echo in response; propagate downstream.
- Propagate W3C `traceparent`/`tracestate`; prefer OpenTelemetry.
- RED metrics (rate, errors, duration); alert on error rate and p99.
- Split probes: `/health/live` (no deps), `/health/ready` (deps, `503` on fail), `/health/startup`.
- Do not fail liveness on downstream blips (avoid restart storms).
